# RAPIDS Usage & Activity Report

## Steps

### 1. Token Usage Report

```bash
aah run core.logging.activity_logger usage
```

Present the cumulative token usage:
- Total input tokens
- Total output tokens
- Total all tokens
- Number of sessions
- Average tokens per session
- Last 5 session breakdowns

### 2. Recent Activity Log

```bash
aah run core.logging.activity_logger activity
```

Present the recent meaningful actions across sessions:
- Tool calls (writes, edits, script runs, agent dispatches)
- Grouped by session with timestamps
- Skip noise (reads, globs, greps)
